Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST Economy: WondersForVictory candidate flag (the
 user's design: a world wonder only if it suits the civ's target victory, or
 is an economy wonder)

A wonder's leaning comes from its flavours; economy wonders (growth, production, gold, happiness, infrastructure, expansion, religion outweighing the victory flavours) stay open to every civ. Applied in CheckBuildingBuildSanity and in CvCityAI's desired-wonder paths. Off in the bundle.

